        <mxCell id="rep_note" value="&lt;b&gt;WHY NO REPORT TABLES IN SCHEMA?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Pre-calculated snapshot tables (e.g. sales_reports) create data drift. In HOYOS, reports are generated dynamically via indexed SQL aggregation queries on orders, order_items, and payments for 100% real-time accuracy." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#CA8A04;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
